#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Newly-Awakened Clairsentient"
msgstr "새롭게 각성한 클레어센션트"

#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Newly-Awakened Clairsentient"
msgstr "새롭게 각성한 클레어센션트"

#. ~ Profession (male Newly-Awakened Clairsentient) description
#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now you can do things that "
"would have once seemed impossible.  You can read much faster and your senses are much sharper; "
"you've been able to hear a zombie scratching at a front door from outside and across the street.  At "
"least once you avoided zombies on the other side of a wall that you didn't hear and couldn't see, "
"but you just knew they were there.  Maybe you felt the vibrations of their movement."
msgstr ""
"대재앙 동안 맹렬한 폭풍이 몰아치는 동안 어떤 일이 일어났습니다. 이제는 한때 불가능해 보였던 일을 할 "
"수 있습니다. 훨씬 더 빨리 읽을 수 있고 감각도 훨씬 더 예리해집니다. 외부와 길 건너편에서 좀비가 현관"
"문을 긁는 소리를 들을 수 있었습니다. 적어도 한 번은 듣지도 못하고 볼 수도 없는 벽 반대편에 있는 좀비"
"를 피했지만, 그들이 거기 있다는 것만 알았어요. 아마도 당신은 그들의 움직임의 진동을 느꼈을 것입니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Newly-Awakened Clairsentient) description
#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now you can do things that "
"would have once seemed impossible.  You can read much faster and your senses are much sharper; "
"you've been able to hear a zombie scratching at a front door from outside and across the street.  At "
"least once you avoided zombies on the other side of a wall that you didn't hear and couldn't see, "
"but you just knew they were there.  Maybe you felt the vibrations of their movement."
msgstr ""
"대재앙 동안 맹렬한 폭풍이 몰아치는 동안 어떤 일이 일어났습니다. 이제는 한때 불가능해 보였던 일을 할 "
"수 있습니다. 훨씬 더 빨리 읽을 수 있고 감각도 훨씬 더 예리해집니다. 외부와 길 건너편에서 좀비가 현관"
