#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ascended Electrokinetic"
msgstr "승천한 일렉트로키네틱"

#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Ascended Electrokinetic"
msgstr "승천한 일렉트로키네틱"

#. ~ Profession (male Ascended Electrokinetic) description
#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now you can do things that "
"would have once seemed impossible.  You managed to drive the entire week the sky broke on a single "
"charge in your car, and while you had to abandon it since then it got you out of the worst of the "
"cities.  Anything that attacks you has to face your lightning and you haven't found anything yet "
"that can withstand it."
msgstr ""
