msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now you can do things that "
"would have once seemed impossible.  Moving things at a distance is child's play.  You can pick up "
"zombies and fling them away from you, shatter doors with a thought, and jump from the fifth story "
