#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Arising Teleporter"
msgstr "떠오르는 텔레포터"

#: professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Arising Teleporter"
msgstr "떠오르는 텔레포터"

#. ~ Profession (male Arising Teleporter) description
#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and now you can do things that "
"would have once seemed impossible.  You can step through walls, and once you were surrounded by a "
"horde and looked up and a nearby rooftop and… there you were, safe and out of the zombies' line of "
"sight.  The rule of the zombie apocalypse is \"keep moving\", and you're the best you've ever been "
"at that."
msgstr ""
"대재앙 도중 일어난 폭풍에 당신의 몸에 변화가 일어났고, 불가능한 일을 할 수 있게 되었습니다. 당신은 벽"
"을 통과해 갈 수 있고, 당신이 좀비 무리에 둘러싸였을 때, 주변 옥상을 찾고는... 순식간에 그 옥상에 서있"
"었고, 좀비들을 피할 수 있었습니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Arising Teleporter) description
#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
