"would have once seemed impossible.  You can step through walls, and once you were surrounded by a "
"horde and looked up and a nearby rooftop and… there you were, safe and out of the zombies' line of "
"sight.  The rule of the zombie apocalypse is \"keep moving\", and you're the best you've ever been "
"at that."
msgstr ""
