#. ~ Profession (female Wild Talent (Theta)) description
#: professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Perhaps the Cataclysm triggered some hidden power that you previously had no idea you possessed, and "
"now you can do things you never previously dreamed possible, or perhaps your powers manifested "
"earlier in your life and you have kept them hidden until now.  You have two random psychic knacks."
msgstr ""
"대재앙 도중 일어난 폭풍에 당신의 몸에 변화가 일어났고, 불가능한 일을 할 수 있게 되었습니다. 아니면 훨"
"씬 이전부터 능력이 발현되었지만 지금까지 숨겨 왔을 수도 있고요. 무작위 초능력 재능 두 개를 얻습니다."

