msgstr[0] "QD944-P '마인드사이트' 안경 (착용 중)"

#. ~ Use action transform.menu_text for {'str': "QD944-P 'Mindsight' glasses
#. (on)", 'str_pl': "sets of QD944-P 'Mindsight' glasses (on)"}.
#. ~ Use action transform.menu_text for {'str': 'everglow matrix flashlight
