#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid "contemplation: biokinesis"
msgstr "묵상: 바이오키네시스"

#. ~ Name for nested category 'contemplation: biokinesis'
#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid "Recipes related to practicing biokinesis."
msgstr "바이오키네시스 연습과 관련된 제작법입니다."

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to resist pain.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 1\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_overcome_pain>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 고통에 저항하는 능력을 향상시키세요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 1\n"
"\n"
"현재 능력 레벨: <u_spell_level:biokin_overcome_pain>"

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to enhance your physical strength and agility.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 2\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_physical_enhance>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 힘과 민첩성을 강화하는 능력을 향상시키세요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 2\n"
"\n"
"현재 능력 레벨: <u_spell_level:biokin_physical_enhance>"

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to draw any possible oxygen from the environment.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 2\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_breathe_skin>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 주변 환경에서 산소를 최대한 끌어들이는 능력을 향상시키세요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 2\n"
"\n"
"현재 능력 레벨: <u_spell_level:biokin_breathe_skin>"

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to cross distances in moments.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 3\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_dash>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 순식간에 먼 거리를 횡단하는 능력을 향상시키세요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 3\n"
"\n"
"현재 능력 레벨: <u_spell_level:biokin_dash>"

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to harden your flesh against incoming damage.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 4\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_armor_skin>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 들어오는 피해에 맞서 몸을 단단하게 만드는 능력을 향상시키세요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 4\n"
"\n"
"현재 능력 레벨: <u_spell_level:biokin_armor_skin>"

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to withstand temperature variations.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 4\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_climate_control>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 온도 변화에 견딜 수 있는 능력을 향상시키세요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 4\n"
"\n"
"현재 능력 레벨: <u_spell_level:biokin_climate_control>"

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to trigger a burst of adrenaline on command.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 4\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_adrenaline>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 명령에 따라 아드레날린 폭발을 일으키는 능력을 향상시키세요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 4\n"
"\n"
"현재 능력 레벨: <u_spell_level:biokin_adrenaline>"

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to deal with encumbering gear.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 5\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_enhance_mobility>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 무거운 장비를 다루는 능력을 향상시키세요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 5\n"
"\n"
"현재 능력 레벨: <u_spell_level:biokin_enhance_mobility>"

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to eschew the use of tools, using your own body in "
"place of a hammer or wrench.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 5\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_hammerhand>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 망치나 렌치 대신 자신의 몸을 사용하여 도구 사용을 피하는 능력을 향상시키세"
"요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 5\n"
"\n"
"현재 능력 레벨: <u_spell_level:biokin_hammerhand>"

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to enhance your reflexes.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 6\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_reflex_enhance>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 반사신경을 강화하는 능력을 향상시키세요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 6\n"
"\n"
"현재 능력 레벨: <u_spell_level:biokin_reflex_enhance>"

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to hermetically seal your body.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 7\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_sealed_system>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 몸을 완벽하게 봉인하는 능력을 향상시키세요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 7\n"
"\n"
"현재 능력 레벨: <u_spell_level:biokin_sealed_system>"

#: recipes/practice/biokinetic_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to extract every possible nutrient from your food "
"and water.\n"
"\n"
"Power Difficulty: 7\n"
"\n"
"Current Power Level: <u_spell_level:biokin_metabolism_enhance>"
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력을 탐구하여 음식과 물에서 가능한 모든 영양소를 추출하는 능력을 향상시키세요.\n"
"\n"
"능력 난이도: 7\n"
